<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 400 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 400 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 200 million zlotys worth of 91-day NBP-bills</p>
<p>and 200 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 : 12:00</p>
<p>    Settlement date	     : September 25,1996</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered : December 25, 1996, June 25,1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
